[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02040000_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02040000_03_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02040000_03_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02040000_03_0010","text":"好的，没问题！\n谢谢！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02040000_03_0020","text":"谢谢惠顾～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02040000_03_0030","text":"（……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02040000_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02040000_03_0032","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02040000_03_0039","text":"训练师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02040000_03_0040","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02040000_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02040000_03_0050","text":"好，辛苦了！\n恋钟酱，今天状态也很棒哦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02040000_03_0060","text":"呵呵～，为了感谢祭\n得好好加油才行呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02040000_03_0070","text":"（……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02040000_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02040000_03_0080","text":"真是了不起的心态！\n那，期待你下次的表现，辛苦了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02040000_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02040000_03_0090","text":"恋钟，辛苦了\n看起来进展顺利，太好了──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02040000_03_0100","text":"──制作人\n……在担心什么呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02040000_03_0110","text":"诶？\n不，那个……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02040000_03_0120","text":"那个眼神……\n跟平时不一样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02040000_03_0130","text":"……是吗……也是\n嗯，我相信大家，但果然还是会担心"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02040000_03_0140","text":"制作人真温柔呢\n把我们看得那么重要"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02040000_03_0150","text":"那是……理所当然的啊\n现在要是能做什么的话，我马上就想去做"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02040000_03_0160","text":"呵呵～，那就请你\n再多再多～地相信我们吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02040000_03_0170","text":"制作人一手打造的\n『L'Antica』，是全宇宙最强的组合哦～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02040000_03_0180","text":"不管发生什么事，\n都有能跨越过去的力量！"}]
